      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Aibakthing]",
      "translation" : "[艾巴克辛]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 23,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hoo! Hah! Hoo! Hah!",
      "translation" : "呼！哈！呼！哈！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 24,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Let me take you away to",
      "translation" : "让我带你前往"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 25,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "a distant spiritual place,",
      "translation" : "遥远而宁静的灵性之地，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 26,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "a land of exotic mystery,",
      "translation" : "一个充满异域神秘色彩的地方，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 27,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "my hometown Ayothaya!",
      "translation" : "我的家乡哎哟泰雅！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 29,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "About Ayothaya.",
      "translation" : "了解哎哟泰雅"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 29,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Go to Ayothaya.",
      "translation" : "前往哎哟泰雅"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 29,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Cancel.",
      "translation" : "取消"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Aibakthing]",
      "translation" : "[艾巴克辛]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 32,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "We Ayothayans are a pious people who value peace and sincerity. We endeavor to lead simple, yet noble, lives in harmony with nature.",
      "translation" : "我们哎哟泰雅人信仰虔诚，珍视和平与真诚。我们追求简朴而高尚的生活，与自然和谐相处。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Aibakthing]",
      "translation" : "[艾巴克辛]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 35,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Our traditional cuisine is world famous. It's no surprise when we serve dishes like Tom Yum Goong, made of Shrimp, Lemon and Chillies, which has a tantalizing aroma and flavor beyond imagining.",
      "translation" : "我们的传统美食举世闻名，这可不是浪得虚名。冬阴功汤以虾、柠檬和辣椒烹制，香气和滋味都诱人得难以想象。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 37,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Aibakthing]",
      "translation" : "[艾巴克辛]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "For those who crave adventure, there is an age old story about the Sa-mhing Tiger, an evil creature that haunts our temple ruins.",
      "translation" : "喜欢冒险的话，我们这里还有一个古老传说：邪恶的萨姆辛虎会在寺庙废墟里出没。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Aibakthing]",
      "translation" : "[艾巴克辛]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hoo! Hahh! Hoo! Hahh!",
      "translation" : "呼！哈！呼！哈！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "No man alive can resist the",
      "translation" : "世上无人能抗拒"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 43,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "call of this beautiful land.",
      "translation" : "这片美丽土地的召唤。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Midgardians are",
      "translation" : "米德加尔特人"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "always welcome!",
      "translation" : "永远受到欢迎！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Aibakthing]",
      "translation" : "[艾巴克辛]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ah, you must pay 10,000 Zeny",
      "translation" : "啊，前往哎哟泰雅需要支付10,000泽尼"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "if you wish to visit Ayothaya.",
      "translation" : "才能踏上旅程。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If you're ready, we can leave",
      "translation" : "如果你准备好了，我们现在"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "right now~",
      "translation" : "就可以出发~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 54,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm ready, let's go!",
      "translation" : "准备好了，出发！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 54,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "No.",
      "translation" : "不了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Aibakthing]",
      "translation" : "[艾巴克辛]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hoo! Hah! Hoo! Hah!",
      "translation" : "呼！哈！呼！哈！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 58,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Let us be off! Back to my",
      "translation" : "我们出发吧！回到我的"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "beautiful Ayothaya!",
      "translation" : "美丽故乡哎哟泰雅！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Aibakthing]",
      "translation" : "[艾巴克辛]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I am sorry, but you do not have the 10,000 Zeny to travel to Ayothaya. Such a price is nothing compared to the experiences that await you!",
      "translation" : "抱歉，你没有足够的10,000泽尼前往哎哟泰雅。和等待你的见闻相比，这点费用根本不算什么！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Aibakthing]",
      "translation" : "[艾巴克辛]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Have you ever dreamed",
      "translation" : "你是否曾梦想过"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 72,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "of a beautiful place filled",
      "translation" : "一个美丽的地方，那里充满"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 73,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "with spiritual serenity? You",
      "translation" : "灵性的宁静？你"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 74,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "must have been dreaming",
      "translation" : "一定是在梦见"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "of Ayothaya, my friend.",
      "translation" : "哎哟泰雅，我的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Aibakthing",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Aibakthing]",
      "translation" : "[艾巴克辛]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Aibakthing",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hoo! Hah! Hmm! Hah!",
      "translation" : "呼！哈！嗯！哈！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "Aibakthing",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "So, how did you like Ayothaya? Did you get a chance to try Tom Yum Goong? When you're ready, I shall take you back home.",
      "translation" : "哎哟泰雅之旅感觉如何？有机会尝尝冬阴功汤了吗？等你准备好，我就送你回家。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Aibakthing",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Go back to Alberta.",
      "translation" : "返回阿尔贝塔"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Aibakthing",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Cancel.",
      "translation" : "取消"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "Aibakthing",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Aibakthing]",
      "translation" : "[艾巴克辛]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 87,
      "npc" : "Aibakthing",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You will be welcome to come back whenever you please. I hope that we will see each other again sometime soon. Thank you~",
      "translation" : "无论何时，你都欢迎再来。我希望我们很快还能再见。谢谢你~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Aibakthing",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Aibakthing]",
      "translation" : "[艾巴克辛]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Aibakthing",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ah yes. I understand that it is difficult to take leave of such a beautiful place. Do not worry",
      "translation" : "啊，我明白。离开这么美丽的地方确实不容易。别担心"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Aibakthing",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "and take your time.",
      "translation" : "慢慢来吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 104,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Thang]",
      "translation" : "[唐]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 105,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There's an ancient,",
      "translation" : "有一座古老而"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 106,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "dreadful building in",
      "translation" : "可怕的建筑，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ayothaya that no one",
      "translation" : "就坐落在哎哟泰雅。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "here dares approach...",
      "translation" : "这里的人谁都不敢靠近..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Thang]",
      "translation" : "[唐]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "In the past, a few curious people went inside, despite the horror stories, and never returned. What on earth could be going on inside of that place?",
      "translation" : "过去，有几个人出于好奇，尽管听过那些恐怖传闻，还是走了进去，之后就再也没有回来。里面到底发生了什么事？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 113,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Thang]",
      "translation" : "[唐]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "However, if you want to prove your courage to others, confronting the danger inside might be a worthy challenge for an adventurer...",
      "translation" : "不过，如果你想向别人证明自己的勇气，冒险进入里面面对危险，也许会是值得一试的挑战..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I think.",
      "translation" : "我是这么想的。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 122,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Lalitha]",
      "translation" : "[拉莉塔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 123,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hello!",
      "translation" : "你好！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 124,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I don't think",
      "translation" : "我想我们"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 125,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "we've met before.",
      "translation" : "以前没见过。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 127,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Lalitha]",
      "translation" : "[拉莉塔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 128,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You must be",
      "translation" : "你一定是"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 129,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "from Midgard.",
      "translation" : "米德加尔特来的。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 130,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "After all, I know every single person living in this village.",
      "translation" : "毕竟，村里每个人我都认识。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 131,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Heh heh~",
      "translation" : "嘿嘿~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 133,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Lalitha]",
      "translation" : "[拉莉塔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 134,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hmm...",
      "translation" : "嗯..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 135,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "May I ask about the land you",
      "translation" : "我可以问问你来自什么地方吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "come from? I'm curious about",
      "translation" : "我对外面的世界"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 137,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "a lot of things in the outside world.",
      "translation" : "有很多好奇的事。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 139,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Lalitha]",
      "translation" : "[拉莉塔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 140,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You know, like the dresses and jewelry that ladies wear in other countries, whether or not the men are good looking, what kind of songs you have, what kind of girls that guys over there like...",
      "translation" : "比如其他国家的女孩穿什么衣服、戴什么首饰，男人长得帅不帅，那边流行什么歌曲，还有那里的男生喜欢什么样的女孩..."
